<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Lightpar '96 net 198.3 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Lightpar '96 net 198.3 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Light Participacoes (Lightpar), a unit of federal power holding company Eletrobras, published the following financial results for 1996.</p>
<p>		    1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share	 19.08 reais	     N/A</p>
<p>    Net	  198.3 million	    N/A</p>
<p>    Oper Revs  154.8 million	    N/A</p>
<p>    Fin Revs    69.6 million	    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in Brazilian reais and not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>No comparative 1995 results were given.</p>
<p>Share figures provided per lot of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>((--James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
